USRBIN             2  ACTIVITY       -29       TGT                    ACT3
USRBIN        ALCASE                             1                     &
DCYSCORE         4.0                          ACT3                    USRBIN
USRBDX           112   NEUTRON       -30    ALCASE    VACREG         1OUT1N
